abstract: "Open-source, self-hostable career assistant: CV, cover-letter and
  resignation generation with template previews, ATS-style resume analysis,
  semantic job matching, job discovery across multiple providers, and
  structured application tracking. FastAPI backend, React frontend, Supabase
  persistence with pgvector, and Hugging Face inference behind a dynamic
  model router with deterministic offline fallbacks."
